Scoped deblock video filter

The option table (deblock_options: filter weak/strong, block, alpha, beta,
gamma, delta, planes), the pixel_fmts list, the threshold conversion and plane
geometry of config_output, the deblockh8/deblockv8 weak and strong kernels and
the block loop of filter_frame in src/video-ops/deblock.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_deblock.c (pixel_fmts, WEAK_HFILTER, WEAK_VFILTER,
STRONG_HFILTER, STRONG_VFILTER, config_output, filter_frame, deblock_options).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
